<title>USA: Ticketmaster, CitySearch in alliance.</title>
<headline>Ticketmaster, CitySearch in alliance.</headline>
<dateline>PASADENA, Calif. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ticketmaster Group Inc said Tuesday it has agreed to provide online ticketing access and live event information to CitySearch, the local city online service.</p>
<p>CitySearch customers will have access to ticket buying and event information while Ticketmaster Online will be provided &quot;substantial&quot; marketing resources, the company said.</p>
<p>Beginning in June, 1997, Ticketmaster said it will be integrated into CitySearch services in New York City, Raleigh-Durham/Chapel Hill, N.C., Portland, Ore. and Nashville, Tenn.</p>
</text>
